  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVID-19: Intensive vegetable production for enhancing nutrition security and resilience to pandemic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support monastic institution to produce variety of vegetables through intensive practices, optimizing the use of limited land. It is expected that the local communities and institutions see the benefits of intensive commercial cultivation through technology and they will also adopt commercial veg farming. the whole community will gain in the end both in terms of nutrition and income from the sale of vegs.</narrative>
  </description>
